Hi folks, we have made some optimizations for Hextones!

[] Better FPS;
[] Fixed MAC performance issues;

Hello Jumpers,
A little bit of extra polishing is never bad! So let's go to what we have here:


FIXED - better precision for choosing up the farthest hexagons from the grid;
FIXED - problems when changing resolution in the video options;
FIXED - text correction on the last page of Instructions screen;
NEW - The TRAVELLERS (Leaderboard) SCREEN has been redesigned. Now everybody is shown on the list;
NEW - Visual and Audio feedback in the Match Result Screen, when you break your own record.
NEW - Audio feedback when you unlock a new Tier and when the match is finished.
